    "encoding_note": "OCP defines no line code; it is a synchronous-logic interface. Byte selection is by MByteEn. The 'tables' here are the signal-group, MCmd command-encoding, SResp response-encoding, dataflow signal-role, and MBurstSeq burst-sequence tables from the OCP specification."
